sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Android app
  participant Gems
  participant Users
  participant P as Google Places API
  participant GDB as Gems DB
  participant UDB as Users DB
  participant Feed as Live Feed

  U->>App: Tap "Add gem"
  App->>Gems: GET /place/nearby?lat&lng[&type]
  Gems->>P: Nearby Search (200 m around the user)
  P-->>Gems: Places
  Gems->>GDB: Which of these are already gems?
  GDB-->>Gems: Gem names
  Gems-->>App: 200 [places, nearest first, with isGem]
  U->>App: Pick a place
  App->>Gems: POST /gem { name, latitude, longitude } (Bearer JWT)
  Gems->>Users: reqJwt(req)
  Users->>UDB: Find user by token subject
  UDB-->>Users: User
  Users-->>Gems: req.user
  Gems->>GDB: Gem with this name exists?
  GDB-->>Gems: No
  Gems->>P: Place Details (name, location, type, rating, review count)
  P-->>Gems: Place
  Gems->>Gems: Check place is within 200 m, compute GemScore
  Gems->>GDB: Insert gem
  Gems->>Feed: publishGemAdded(gem)
  Feed-->>Feed: Send { type: "gem.added", gem } to apps whose area contains it
  Gems-->>App: 201 gem
  App-->>U: Show the new gem on the map
  Note over Gems,App: Errors: 401 not signed in, 409 already a gem,<br/>422 no such place / too far, 502 Google Places unavailable
